    "summary": "A field with several label elements pointing at it is announced inconsistently across screen readers.",
    "reviewedAt": "2026-11-16T00:00:00Z",
    "wrong": "When two `<label>` elements reference the same field, for example a visible label and a second one added for styling, screen readers may read one, both or neither.",
