    "reviewedAt": "2026-11-16T00:00:00Z",
    "wrong": "An `<input type=\"image\">` without `alt` text gives screen readers nothing to announce, or just the image file name.",
    "affects": "Screen reader users, who can't tell what the graphical button does, such as search or checkout.",
    "howToFix": "Add an `alt` attribute that describes the action, not the picture: \"Search\", not \"magnifying glass\". Or replace it with a `<button>` containing an icon and hidden text.",
    "codeSnippet": "### Incorrect\n```html\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\">\n```\n\n### Correct\n```html\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\" alt=\"Search\">\n\n<!-- Or a button element -->\n<button type=\"submit\">\n  <img src=\"/icons/search.png\" alt=\"\">\n  <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Search</span>\n</button>\n```\n\n### React / Next.js (JSX)\n```jsx\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\" alt=\"Search\" />\n```\n\n### Vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\" :alt=\"t('search.submit')\" />\n</template>\n```",
    "howToCheck": "Tab to the image button with a screen reader on and confirm it announces the action. Then rescan with EveryVisitor.",
    "bodyMd": "# Add alt text to image buttons\n\n## What's wrong\n\nAn `<input type=\"image\">` without `alt` text gives screen readers nothing to announce, or just the image file name.\n\n## Who it affects\n\nScreen reader users, who can't tell what the graphical button does, such as search or checkout.\n\n## How to fix on a custom-coded site\n\nAdd an `alt` attribute that describes the action, not the picture: \"Search\", not \"magnifying glass\". Or replace it with a `<button>` containing an icon and hidden text.\n\n## Code example\n\n### Incorrect\n```html\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\">\n```\n\n### Correct\n```html\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\" alt=\"Search\">\n\n<!-- Or a button element -->\n<button type=\"submit\">\n  <img src=\"/icons/search.png\" alt=\"\">\n  <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Search</span>\n</button>\n```\n\n### React / Next.js (JSX)\n```jsx\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\" alt=\"Search\" />\n```\n\n### Vue\n```vue\n<template>\n  <input type=\"image\" src=\"/icons/search.png\" :alt=\"t('search.submit')\" />\n</template>\n```\n\n## How to check your fix\n\nTab to the image button with a screen reader on and confirm it announces the action. Then rescan with EveryVisitor."
