    "affects": "Screen reader users browsing by landmarks or frames cannot decide whether to enter or skip the frame.",
    "howToFix": "Add `title=\"{{ section.settings.video_title | escape }}\"` to all video embed or app iframes in Liquid section templates.",
    "codeSnippet": "### Incorrect\n```liquid\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ video_id }}\"></iframe>\n```\n\n### Correct\n```liquid\n<iframe\n  src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ video_id }}\"\n  title=\"{{ 'sections.video.embed_title' | t: title: section.settings.heading | escape }}\"\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n></iframe>\n```",
    "howToCheck": "Inspect each `<iframe>` element in DevTools and confirm a clear, descriptive `title` attribute exists.",
    "bodyMd": "# Add informative title attributes to iframes in Shopify\n\n## What's wrong\n\nIframes without titles are announced merely as 'frame', leaving users unaware of the third-party content embedded.\n\n## Who it affects\n\nScreen reader users browsing by landmarks or frames cannot decide whether to enter or skip the frame.\n\n## How to fix on Shopify\n\nAdd `title=\"{{ section.settings.video_title | escape }}\"` to all video embed or app iframes in Liquid section templates.\n\n## Code example\n\n### Incorrect\n```liquid\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ video_id }}\"></iframe>\n```\n\n### Correct\n```liquid\n<iframe\n  src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ video_id }}\"\n  title=\"{{ 'sections.video.embed_title' | t: title: section.settings.heading | escape }}\"\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n></iframe>\n```\n\n## How to check your fix\n\nInspect each `<iframe>` element in DevTools and confirm a clear, descriptive `title` attribute exists."
