    "codeSnippet": "### Incorrect\n```php\n<a href=\"<?php the_permalink(); ?>\" class=\"post-card\">\n  <h2><?php the_title(); ?></h2>\n  <a href=\"/category/news\" class=\"badge\">News</a>\n</a>\n```\n\n### Correct\n```php\n<div class=\"post-card\">\n  <h2><a href=\"<?php the_permalink(); ?>\"><?php the_title(); ?></a></h2>\n  <a href=\"/category/news\" class=\"badge\">News</a>\n</div>\n```",
